                                "sense_id": "64528b24-c8cd-3f36-9825-89d99c01c2d0",
                                "text": "[Afonso de] Albuquerque, throughout his career, favoured the Hindu paganry against the Hindí Moslems, finding the former much less intractable."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "268b4af3-554a-4f9a-a4ea-527d00233c6d",
                                "sense_id": "64528b24-c8cd-3f36-9825-89d99c01c2d0",
                                "text": "Yet you could hunt for slaves in the countries round about: Celtic Christians of the far West, generally treated as heretics; Islam; Slavonic, Baltic or Finnish 'paganries'"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c7e0e61c-6448-4837-af86-376359d7608c",
                                "sense_id": "64528b24-c8cd-3f36-9825-89d99c01c2d0",
                                "text": "missionary progressives ready to teach the paganry the rudiments of tithing and toothbrushing"
                            }
                        ]
